{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And he called its name Sitnah.</b> It does not explain on what basis he called its name Sitnah, as it explains Esek — because they contended with him. Rather, from the first one he said: perhaps then they disputed. And when he saw that they were disputing over the second one as well, he said: it is certainly hatred and enmity, and for this reason it does not explain."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:05.639414152Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}